---
pre-compare: sort
---

// Synthetic PAN-OS records in RFC 5424 Syslog messages; every value is
// invented. The column order follows the PAN-OS 11.1 Traffic, URL Filtering,
// Threat, GlobalProtect, and Audit log fields; the last record has an
// unsupported layout.
// https://docs.paloaltonetworks.com/ngfw/administration/monitoring/use-syslog-for-monitoring/syslog-field-descriptions
from_file env("TENZIR_INPUT") {
  read_lines
}
this = line.parse_syslog()
paloalto::ocsf::normalize
drop_null_fields
